boundary        f f f
atom_style      bond

fix             signals all property/atom d2_signals 3 ghost yes
read_data       ${data} fix signals NULL Signals
read_data       23Oct_chr2_rw_seed42_without_H3K27ac.data fix signals NULL Signals
